---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact FCMOBILETOOLS for corrections, account questions, privacy concerns and copyright reports.">
  <article class="wrap legal-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p>
    <h1>Contact FCMOBILETOOLS</h1>
    <p class="legal-lead">Last updated: October 9, 2026</p>
    <p>Use the official TanzimFC channels below. Include the relevant page or feature when reporting a problem.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Official channels</h2>
      <div class="legal-links">
        <a href="https://discord.com/invite/B4a7AxuU69" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord Community</a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@tanzimfc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a>
        <a href="https://x.com/TanzimFC" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X / Twitter</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Corrections and account questions</h2>
      <p>Tell us about incorrect game information, expired redeem codes, a broken calculator, account access trouble, missing quest progress, survey problems or incorrect XP and Token records. Share the page URL and a brief description. Never send your password, sign-in codes or other sensitive credentials.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
      <p>You can use the official channels to request access to, correction of or deletion of personal information you provided to us. We may ask for enough information to verify your request. Some records may need to be retained for security, disputes or legal reasons.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Copyright reports</h2>
      <p>For a copyright or other rights concern, include the relevant URL, identify the material and explain your rights and the reason for your report. See our <a href="/legal/copyright">Copyright &amp; Intellectual Property page</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Creator and partnership enquiries</h2>
      <p>Use the official channels for creator applications, editorial corrections, collaborations and partnership enquiries. A message does not guarantee a reply, publication, partnership or payment.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>EA account support</h2>
      <p>FCMOBILETOOLS cannot access or manage EA accounts, handle purchases or refunds, reverse bans or issue official game rewards. For these matters, contact EA through its official support service.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
